## Utilization Audit (The "Fat Trimming")
After execution, we will analyze [events.jsonl](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/.gemini/antigravity/brain/7c654df4-b83e-43f9-8620-f15868ec39d1/ledger/events.jsonl) and tool logs to categorize every Phase 0-12 feature:
- **Vital:** Critical to workflow (High Value).
- **Useful:** Good to have, but not blocking.
- **Underutilized:** Available but not used (Why?).
- **Dead Weight:** Not used, adds friction (Candidate for removal).

## Success Criteria
1.  **Nucleus Task** results in higher quality code (Critic-verified) and preserved context (Strategy updated).
2.  **Task C** is moved from "Pending" to "Done".
3.  **Utilization Audit** identifies at least 1 "Underutilized" feature to improve or deprecate.
